  "description": "Jacqueline, a girl who had to survive in the abandoned lands at the border of three nations. Her world consisted of only one thing: her younger brother. But one day, the moment her brother awoke as a “Special Human,” Jacqueline was forced to hand him over to the state in the name of “protection.” Having lost everything, she was then saddled with yet another burden by “Margo,” the very person who had taken her brother away and served as his guardian. An unknown young new-born, “Demi.” And as time passed, Demi and Jacqueline reunited as if by fate...\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
